# Counter-example: a slotForm holding a bare literal (fires lang:StringOnlyForm / shacl.NodeKindConstraintComponent).

@prefix lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:slot a lang:FormSlot ; lang:slotForm "not a form" .
